meta {
  name: Generate AI Course Recommendations
  type: http
  seq: 1
}

post {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/api/ai/course-recommendations
  body: json
  auth: bearer
}

headers {
  Content-Type: application/json
  Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
}

auth:bearer {
  token: {{authToken}}
}

body:json {
  {
    "industry": "FinTech",
    "startupStage": "Seed Stage",
    "learningGoals": "Master RBI digital lending guidelines and Indian unit economics."
  }
}

docs {
  # Generate AI Course Recommendations
  Leverage Google Gemini AI to analyze startup context and recommend tailored incubation courses.

  ### Authentication
  Bearer Token

  ### Allowed Roles
  - Founder
- Mentor
- Admin

  ### Response Status Codes
  - `200` - Recommended courses returned with syllabus and rationale.
  - `500` - AI generation error.

  ### Response Example (200)
  ```json
  {
    "success": true,
    "courses": [
      {
        "id": "crs_rec_1",
        "title": "FinTech Compliance & RBI Master Directions",
        "instructor": "Vikram Sethi",
        "difficulty": "Intermediate",
        "durationHours": 6,
        "priceINR": 0,
        "summary": "Comprehensive guide to compliant NBFC & payment gateway operations in India."
      }
    ]
  }
  ```
}
